OL,3,GNEWSAImages appeal after multiple
OL,4,Aindecent exposures
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice are appealing for images and
OL,7,Fvideos following reports of a man
OL,8,Fexposing himself on multiple occasions
OL,9,Fin Essex.
OL,11,FVictims told officers the incidents had
OL,12,Ftaken place in Danbury between 18 July
OL,13,Fand 9 September at locations and fields
OL,14,Fbetween St John the Baptist Church and
OL,15,FDanbury Tennis Club.
OL,17,FThe man was also seen in Penny Royal
OL,18,FRoad, Nursery Lane and Hopping Jacks
OL,19,FLane. He was described as aged between
OL,20,F17 and 30, of slim build, with
OL,21,Fshoulder-length wavy black hair and a
OL,22,Fshort beard.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
